    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      504.87,
      549.68,
      590.94
    ],
    "text": "I, Madduma Kankanamalage Bandula Harischandra, Governor of the Southern Province hereby kindly noti\ufb01 ed that the following resolution passed by the Ambalangoda Urban Council in the Galle District at its meeting held on 01st of July, 2025 under Resolution No. 05.01.01.01 by virtue of the powers vested in me by Sub-section (1) of Section 2 of the Entertainment Tax Ordinance (Chap. 267) that should be cited with Paragraph (a) of Sub-section (1) of Section 2 of the Provincial Councils (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989, has been approved by me in terms of the powers vested in me by Sub-section (2) of Section 2 of the Entertainment Tax Ordinance.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      604.87,
      534.0,
      690.94
    ],
    "text": "M\u0d7a\u0d7d\u0d7d\u0d8e\u0d86\u0d7a K\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d84\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d7a\u0d86\u0d7a\u0d85\u0d7a\u0d80\u0d7e B\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d8e\u0d85\u0d7a H\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d82\u0d8c\u0d7c\u0d81\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d8b\u0d7a, Governor, Southern Province. At the Governor\u2019s O\ufb03 ce, Southern Province.25th September, 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
